<title>SPAIN: Spain's Pryca gross sales down 0.6 pct in Jan, Feb.</title>
<headline>Spain's Pryca gross sales down 0.6 pct in Jan, Feb.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain hypermarket chain Pryca said on Tuesday its gross sales were 88.7 billion pesetas in the first two months of the year, with a fall of 0.6 percent compared with the same period one year ago.</p>
<p>Pryca shares added 45 pesetas to 2,655 pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
